  Warning  BackOff    2m (x47 over 1h12m)  kubelet            Back-off restarting failed container
  Warning  OOMKilling 7m                   kernel-monitor     Memory cgroup out of memory: Killed process 1
"""
    if pod_name.startswith("ledger-worker"):
        return f"""Name:         {pod_name}
Namespace:    payments
Status:       Pending
Containers:
  ledger-worker:
    Image:          registry.internal/payments/ledger-worker:v2.4.99
    State:          Waiting
      Reason:       ImagePullBackOff
